@startuml game_core
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title Canonical game primitives
component "Typed squares + actions + snapshots" as TYPES <<app>>
component "Board placement + attack geometry" as BOARD <<app>>
component "Economy + special costs + turn clocks" as ECONOMY <<app>>
component "Terminal outcomes" as OUTCOME <<app>>
component "Native moves + mine geometry" as MOVES <<app>>
component "Cumulative fog + path reveals" as VISION <<app>>
component "Bun regression tests" as TESTS <<app>>
BOARD --> TYPES
ECONOMY --> TYPES
ECONOMY --> BOARD : deployed material
OUTCOME --> TYPES
MOVES --> BOARD
VISION --> BOARD
TESTS ..> BOARD
TESTS ..> ECONOMY
TESTS ..> OUTCOME
TESTS ..> MOVES
TESTS ..> VISION
note bottom of TESTS
  Retain canonical rules, not legacy AI planners.
  Move generation is not queue/resolve eligibility.
  Simultaneous resolution and recipient DTOs remain pending.
end note
@enduml
